 Deep Copy vs Shallow Copy
🔷 1. Definition
✅ Shallow Copy

Only top-level properties copy hotat, pan nested objects same reference detat

👉 Meaning:

Outer copy ✅
Inner (nested) ❌ same memory


✅ Deep Copy

Complete object (including nested) full copy hoto

👉 Meaning:

Outer ✅ new copy
Inner ✅ new copy
✅ No shared reference